Disable mouse grabbing when mouse untrapping is enabled.

When running the emulator, mouse grabbing traps the cursor inside the
window, which makes window switching and debugging cumbersome. This patch
allows untrapping the mouse (releasing the SDL mouse capture) as long as
tablet mode (absolute pointing) is enabled, even before the guest-side
mousehack driver has loaded or became alive.

Additionally, clicking the left mouse button inside the emulator window
will no longer grab the mouse if mouse untrapping is configured and tablet
mode is active. Fullscreen still grabs on click.

Index: demoscene-toolchain/submodules/amiberry/src/osdep/amiberry.cpp
===================================================================
